B.a0k=new A.bf(B.jl,["Is my financial and banking data secure?","Yes. Blupp uses client-side encryption and row-level security (RLS) powered by Supabase. Your raw bank credentials are never stored. iOS automation runs completely locally on your device via Apple Shortcuts."],t.li)
